v 3
d 'SUSO': module providing a Stata client for the Survey Solutions REST API
d
d suso is a Stata interface to the World Bank Survey Solutions REST API and
d includes paradata timing, behaviour flags, exhaustive AnswerRemoved inventory,
d hierarchy-aware final-data enablement adjudication, a tabbed QC suite, a
d compact interview event history timeline, and direct Headquarters
d interview/assignment links in the paradata HTML.
d Build: 2026-09-05-CENTERED (v1.7.36; Java backend 1.7.32-SECTIONS).
d
d Requires: Stata 14.2 or newer and Java 11 or newer.
d Distribution-Date: 20260905
d Author: Attique Ur Rehman, The World Bank
d Support: email attique@worldbank.org
d
f suso.ado
f suso.sthlp
f suso.jar
